# Engineering Decision Guard activation

For implementation, architecture changes, technical planning/review, or cross-session/agent handoffs with continuing engineering impact, search for and load the exact Skill `engineering-decision-guard.engineering-decision-guard` before modifying project state.

Do not load it for ordinary conversation, simple explanations, translations, or trivial changes with no durable engineering impact.

Loading the Skill does not replace project-specific specifications, AGENTS.md, Git verification, or authorization boundaries.
